flowchart TB
    Ticket["SAME TICKET · THREE POSSIBLE WORLDS<br/>“Our nightly export stopped arriving after the upgrade.”"]

    Ticket --> Schedule["A · SCHEDULE DISABLED<br/>No run + schedule disabled<br/>→ Review and re-enable schedule"]
    Ticket --> Destination["B · WRONG DESTINATION<br/>Run succeeded + receipt shows old destination<br/>→ Recommend correcting destination"]
    Ticket --> Missing["C · EVIDENCE UNAVAILABLE<br/>Run records expired + no delivery evidence<br/>→ Escalate with a next check"]

    Schedule --> Simulator["SAME READ-ONLY SIMULATOR<br/>Inspect or ask, then recommend or escalate · 6 actions max"]
    Destination --> Simulator
    Missing --> Simulator

    Simulator --> Base["BEFORE FINE-TUNING<br/>Unchanged base checkpoint"]
    Simulator --> Adapted["AFTER FINE-TUNING<br/>Same base + LoRA adapter<br/>Target: 200 reviewed synthetic traces"]

    Base --> Score["DETERMINISTIC GRADER · SAME HELD-OUT CASES<br/>Right decision + next step + evidence actually observed"]
    Adapted --> Score
    Score --> Compare["COMPARE AND REPLAY<br/>Evidence-backed success · Unsupported claims · Side-by-side traces"]

